---
---
<section class="section" id="pricing">
  <div class="section__inner">

    <div class="pricing__header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Wedding Packages</span>
      <span class="gold-line" style="margin: 0 auto var(--sp-3);"></span>
      <h2 class="pricing__heading">Choose your <em>beginning.</em></h2>
      <p class="pricing__sub">Every package includes exclusive venue use, 3 nights on-site accommodation, string lights, bonfire, dance floor, ceremonial altar, and welcome drinks. Catering and photography are arranged separately.</p>
      <div class="pricing__anchor">
        Comparable Tulum resort weddings start at <strong>$18,000–$25,000</strong>.<br>
        Casa Arkaana starts at <strong class="pricing__anchor-price">$2,500</strong> — with 3 nights included.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing__grid">

      <!-- The Roots -->
      <div class="pricing__card">
        <p class="pricing__name">The Roots</p>
        <h3 class="pricing__title">Intimate<br>Ceremony</h3>
        <p class="pricing__price">$2,500<span class="pricing__price-range">–3,000</span></p>
        <p class="pricing__price-note">USD · up to 25 guests</p>
        <div class="pricing__divider"></div>
        <ul class="pricing__list">
          <li>Full venue, 3 nights</li>
          <li>Sacred ceremony under the Sapote Tree</li>
          <li>String lights throughout the property</li>
          <li>Ceremonial bonfire</li>
          <li>Altar design by Maja &amp; Asdrubal</li>
          <li>Welcome drinks for all guests</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary pricing__btn">Inquire</a>
      </div>

      <!-- The Tree (featured) -->
      <div class="pricing__card pricing__card--featured">
        <span class="pricing__badge">Most Popular</span>
        <p class="pricing__name">The Tree</p>
        <h3 class="pricing__title">Full<br>Celebration</h3>
        <p class="pricing__price">$4,500<span class="pricing__price-range">–5,500</span></p>
        <p class="pricing__price-note">USD · up to 40 guests</p>
        <div class="pricing__divider"></div>
        <ul class="pricing__list">
          <li>Everything in The Roots</li>
          <li>Extended celebration hours</li>
          <li>Wooden dance floor, set and lit</li>
          <li>Sound system &amp; lighting rig</li>
          <li>Dinner tables styled for the jungle</li>
          <li>Bridal suite access the night before</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary pricing__btn pricing__btn--featured">Inquire</a>
      </div>

      <!-- The Bloom -->
      <div class="pricing__card">
        <p class="pricing__name">The Bloom</p>
        <h3 class="pricing__title">Full Journey<br>&amp; Festival</h3>
        <p class="pricing__price">$7,000<span class="pricing__price-range">–9,000</span></p>
        <p class="pricing__price-note">USD · up to 60 guests</p>
        <div class="pricing__divider"></div>
        <ul class="pricing__list">
          <li>Everything in The Tree</li>
          <li>Cacao ceremony the morning after</li>
          <li>Temazcal experience for the wedding party</li>
          <li>Full floral altar &amp; table centrepieces</li>
          <li>Custom ambient music curated for your day</li>
          <li>Dedicated planning support from Maja</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary pricing__btn">Inquire</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="pricing__note">All prices are starting points. We'll build an exact quote for your guest count, dates, and vision. <a href="#contact" class="pricing__note-link">Reach out to start the conversation →</a></p>
    <p class="pricing__green-season">The jungle is most alive in the green season — May through October. Fewer visitors, lush canopy, lower starting rates. <a href="#contact">Ask us about green season availability.</a></p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing__header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--sp-10);
  }

  .pricing__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .pricing__heading em { font-style: italic; }

  .pricing__sub {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pricing__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: var(--max-content);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing__card {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(140,136,118,0.2);
    padding: var(--sp-6);
    position: relative;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s var(--ease), transform 0.3s var(--ease);
  }

  .pricing__card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(181,144,78,0.12);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .pricing__card--featured {
    border-color: var(--color-gold);
    background: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .pricing__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: var(--sp-6);
    background: var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 12px;
  }

  .pricing__name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-1);
  }

  .pricing__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .pricing__price {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .pricing__price-range {
    font-size: 0.55em;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
  }

  .pricing__price-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .pricing__divider {
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .pricing__list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .pricing__list li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 9px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .pricing__btn {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    display: block;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .pricing__btn--featured {
    background: var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .pricing__note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--sp-8);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .pricing__note-link {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .pricing__green-season {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pricing__green-season a {
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(140,136,118,0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .pricing__green-season a:hover {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .pricing__anchor {
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
    padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(181,144,78,0.4);
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pricing__anchor strong {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .pricing__anchor-price {
    color: var(--color-gold) !important;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .pricing__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>
